<item>
            <title>[PARQUET-2354] Apparent race condition in CharsetValidator</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-2354</link>
                <project id="12315521" key="PARQUET">Parquet</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The&#160;&lt;tt&gt;CharsetValidator&lt;/tt&gt;&#160;has a static singleton instance at&#160;&lt;tt&gt;BinaryTruncator.DEFAULT_UTF8_TRUNCATOR.validator&lt;/tt&gt;, so it can be accessed from multiple threads. All threads operate on a shared &quot;dummy buffer&quot; for decoding.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13552001">PARQUET-2354</key>
