                            <comment id="17769478" author="githubbot" created="Wed, 27 Sep 2023 08:34:27 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;findepi commented on PR #1154:&lt;br/&gt;
URL: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/parquet-mr/pull/1154#issuecomment-1736950116&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/parquet-mr/pull/1154#issuecomment-1736950116&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;   Thank you @wgtmac @Fokko for your review!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;   BTW i failed to run the failing test locally because brew installs too new thrift version. Can one of you please help me understand what do i need to do to fix it?&lt;/p&gt;

</comment>
                            <comment id="17769487" author="githubbot" created="Wed, 27 Sep 2023 08:48:14 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fokko commented on PR #1154:&lt;br/&gt;
URL: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/parquet-mr/pull/1154#issuecomment-1736975904&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/parquet-mr/pull/1154#issuecomment-1736975904&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;   So with Thrift they bumped the minimal version of Java to 11, so Parquet was unable to upgrade since we still support Java 8. With Thrift 0.19 they backported Java 8 support on my request, let me fix &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/parquet-mr/pull/1138&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/parquet-mr/pull/1138&lt;/a&gt; and then you should be able to test locally.&lt;/p&gt;

</comment>
                            <comment id="17769936" author="githubbot" created="Thu, 28 Sep 2023 07:46:26 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;wgtmac merged PR #1154:&lt;br/&gt;
URL: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/parquet-mr/pull/1154&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/parquet-mr/pull/1154&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

