&lt;p&gt;   @Fokko thank you for explaining the thrift problem!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;   @wgtmac thank you for the merge!&lt;/p&gt;

</comment>
                            <comment id="17859301" author="rok" created="Sun, 23 Jun 2024 03:33:09 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This issue has been migrated to &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/parquet-java/issues/2819&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;issue #2819&lt;/a&gt; on GitHub. Please see the &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-2502&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;migration documentation&lt;/a&gt; for further details.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
